      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRISH LAD (2) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts three wins and two placings. Placed last time (17.78) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten half a length. Rates a leading player. SHE'S WATCHING (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.61) at this track behind Bad Boy Jay in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Expected to feature. CHEVY THE BEAST (7) has a strong record this track and trip including three wins from five starts. Comes off a (17.56) win last time, scoring by 2.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Looks one of the chances. SUPER SKUNK (3) can sneak into the finish.",
